                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Plan:\n1. Identify the situation described in the question.\n2. Determine the type of response exhibited by the bird.\n3. Match the response to the given options.\n\nAnswer:\n1. The situation described in the question is that a bird eats a brightly-colored insect that tastes bad.\n2. The bird avoids preying on this type of insect again, which indicates that it has learned to associate the bright color of the insect with a bad taste.\n3. The response exhibited by the bird is a learned behavior, which is option B. Therefore, the correct answer is B) a learned behavior.",
