                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the best way to describe the bird's avoidance of a brightly-colored insect that tastes bad after eating it once?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- The bird ate a brightly-colored insect that tasted bad.\n- After this experience, the bird avoids preying on this type of insect again.\n- This suggests that the bird learned from its previous experience.\n- Therefore, the best way to describe this example is as a learned behavior.\n\nAnswer: B) a learned behavior.",
