                        "cot": " \n\nIn a chemical reaction, you have reactants and products. The reactants are the starting materials, and the products are the materials that are formed as a result of the reaction. \n\nIn this reaction, the reactants are hydrogen and oxygen. The product is water. \n\nWater is a compound, because it is made up of two elements, hydrogen and oxygen.",
