                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the term used to describe the sum of protons and neutrons in the nucleus of an atom?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- Protons and neutrons are both subatomic particles found in the nucleus of an atom.\n- The sum of these two particles would give us the total number of particles in the nucleus.\n- This total number is known as the mass number of the atom.\n- Therefore, the term used to describe the sum of protons and neutrons in the nucleus of an atom is the mass number.\n\nAnswer: B) mass number.",
