                        "cot": " Decreasing the heat energy of a gas would cause the gas to cool. Cooling a gas can cause condensation, evaporation, and vaporization. Radiation is not a result of decreasing the heat energy of a gas. Therefore, the correct answer is A) condensation, B) evaporation, and D) vaporization.",
