                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What is the most likely benefit for people from the development of new satellite technology to predict the weather?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n- The new satellite technology is being developed to predict the weather.\n- Therefore, it will likely provide more accurate and timely information about weather patterns.\n- This information can be used to warn people about dangerous storms.\n- Therefore, the most likely benefit for people from the development of this technology is that it will help warn them about dangerous storms.\n\nAnswer: C) It will help warn people about dangerous storms.",
